## Shapes

{fill="#fffbe6" h=18mm kind=roundrect stroke="#d4b02c" w=55mm x=95mm y=-2mm}
::: shape
A shape over the text
:::

Shapes float over the paragraph that follows them, and move with it when you
edit above. Drag a shape to move it and use its corner to resize it.

